,"References",null],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"doc":1,"prev":38,"next":41},{"slug":2,"num":3,"title":4,"html":5,"toc":6,"summary":37},"operations",20,"Operations","\u003Cp>Run these commands on a node, as \u003Ccode>root\u003C/code>.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"see-the-cluster\">\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#see-the-cluster\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/a>See the cluster\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">patronictl\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /etc/patroni/config.yml\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003C/div>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"planned-leader-change\">\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#planned-leader-change\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/a>Planned leader change\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">patronictl\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /etc/patroni/config.yml\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> switchover\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>Use this before you restart or resize the leader.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"restart-postgres\">\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#restart-postgres\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/a>Restart Postgres\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">patronictl\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /etc/patroni/config.yml\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> restart\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">nam\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">e\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">membe\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003C/div>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"change-a-postgres-setting\">\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#change-a-postgres-setting\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/a>Change a Postgres setting\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">patronictl\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /etc/patroni/config.yml\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> edit-config\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>Patroni applies the change on all nodes. Some settings need a restart.\n\u003Ccode>patronictl list\u003C/code> shows &quot;Pending restart&quot;.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"rebuild-a-broken-replica\">\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#rebuild-a-broken-replica\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/a>Rebuild a broken replica\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">patronictl\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /etc/patroni/config.yml\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reinit\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">nam\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">e\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">membe\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003C/div>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"check-etcd\">\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#check-etcd\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/a>Check etcd\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ETCDCTL_API\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> etcdctl\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --endpoints=http://127.0.0.1:2379\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> endpoint\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> health\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ETCDCTL_API\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> etcdctl\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --endpoints=http://127.0.0.1:2379\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> member\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003C/div>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"check-pgbouncer\">\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#check-pgbouncer\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/a>Check PgBouncer\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">psql\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -h\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 127.0.0.1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 6432\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -U\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pgbouncer\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pgbouncer\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"SHOW POOLS\"\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">psql\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -h\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 127.0.0.1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 6432\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -U\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pgbouncer\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pgbouncer\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"SHOW STATS\"\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>The password is \u003Ccode>pgbouncer_password\u003C/code> in the state file. \u003Ccode>cl_waiting\u003C/code> shows\nthe clients that wait for a connection.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"open-a-superuser-session\">\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#open-a-superuser-session\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/a>Open a superuser session\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">runuser\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -u\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> postgres\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> psql\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003C/div>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"grow-a-volume\">\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#grow-a-volume\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/a>Grow a volume\u003C/h3>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Resize the volume in the Hetzner console. A volume can grow, not shrink.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>On the node: \u003Ccode>resize2fs /dev/disk/by-id/scsi-0HC_Volume_&lt;id&gt;\u003C/code>.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Do this for all nodes.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"things-to-monitor\">\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#things-to-monitor\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/a>Things to monitor\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>With \u003Ccode>--monitor\u003C/code> or \u003Ccode>pgha monitor install\u003C/code>, each node checks replication\nlag, free space on the data directory, the backup repository, PgBouncer\n\u003Ccode>cl_waiting\u003C/code>, a missing primary, a missing member, and local Patroni.\nRead section 18.\u003C/p>\n",[7,10,13,16,19,22,25,28,31,34],{"id":8,"text":9},"see-the-cluster","See the cluster",{"id":11,"text":12},"planned-leader-change","Planned leader change",{"id":14,"text":15},"restart-postgres","Restart Postgres",{"id":17,"text":18},"change-a-postgres-setting","Change a Postgres setting",{"id":20,"text":21},"rebuild-a-broken-replica","Rebuild a broken replica",{"id":23,"text":24},"check-etcd","Check etcd",{"id":26,"text":27},"check-pgbouncer","Check PgBouncer",{"id":29,"text":30},"open-a-superuser-session","Open a superuser session",{"id":32,"text":33},"grow-a-volume","Grow a volume",{"id":35,"text":36},"things-to-monitor","Things to monitor","Run these commands on a node, as root.",{"slug":39,"title":40},"move-from-an-existing-server","Move from an existing server",{"slug":42,"title":43},"troubleshooting","Troubleshooting"],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
